    "description": "Mechanical single-jet dry dial water meter for metering of cold water, designed to measure, memorize and display the volume at metering conditions of water passing through the measurement transducer. Intended for measurement of volumes of clean cold water in household or residential use. Essential parts: measuring mechanism in the lower part of the meter body (rotary vane wheel with axle perpendicular to flow direction, lower and upper tightening plates with bearing hubs); dry type mechanical register (register chamber casing may be plastic) with 8 numbered drums and 1 continuously moving rotating pointer; housing with inlet and outlet thread connections (brass body for SD-A, plastic body for SD-AP); adjustment device (angular orientation of the seal plate or hinge plug screw, optionally); magnetic coupling for connection of measuring mechanism with mechanical register. Non-essential optional parts: inlet strainer, non-return valve. Optional integrated function: pulse output. Software: not applicable."
